        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I am the one who will take your life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those who do not respect the sanctity of life...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
